{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"LinearIncrementingEntityIdGenerator"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/FirebladeECS\/documentation\/FirebladeECS\/SavingAndLoadingScenes"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This entity id generator creates linearly incrementing entity ids","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"unless an entity is marked as unused then the marked id is returned next in a FIFO order","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with an increased generation.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The slot index 0 is reserved and never provided; slots start at generation 0. A slot whose generation reaches ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UInt32.max"},{"text":" is retired and never provided again.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Furthermore it respects order of entity ids on initialization, meaning the provided ids on initialization will be provided in order"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"until all are in use. After that the free entities start at the lowest available id increasing linearly skipping already in-use entity ids."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"metadata":{"title":"LinearIncrementingEntityIdGenerator","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"LinearIncrementingEntityIdGenerator"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"LinearIncrementingEntityIdGenerator","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"struct","roleHeading":"Structure","externalID":"s:12FirebladeECS35LinearIncrementingEntityIdGeneratorV","modules":[{"name":"FirebladeECS"}]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"seeAlsoSections":[{"gen